# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DEPRECATED / REMOVED — These vars no longer exist in code
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SUPEREZIO_AUTONOMOUS_ENGINE    → Removed, no longer referenced in code
# SUPEREZIO_STUDY_MIN_AGE_DAYS   → Removed, no longer referenced in code
# ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY           → Use ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY (underscore)
# TWELVEDATA_API_KEY             → Use TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY (underscore)
# NEWSAPI_API_KEY                → Use NEWSAPI_KEY (no _API between NEWSAPI and KEY)
# FORM4_API_KEY                  → Use FORM4API_KEY (no underscore)
# SUPEREZIO_MAX_CONFIDENCE_GATE_FAILURE → Use SUPEREZIO_MAX_CONFIDENCE_WITH_GATE_FAILURE
